WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.190
Now, we're going to start Kaleido Star.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.550
When you watch Kaleido Star,

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.720
keep your room brightly lit

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.060
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.320
Yes, Miss Layla!

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:11.960
Well, well, well.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.720
Everyone, have you ever been told,
"Don't push yourself too hard"?

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.600
"You should try it next time," or

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.500
"Why don't you try harder next time?"
or something like that.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:21.640
But there is something I can't
accomplish unless I do it right now.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.630
I have to fight now.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.280
I don't want to feel regret because I didn't try.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.170
I don't want that! I don't want that!

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:35.320
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:35.320
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.820
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.820
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:59.880
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:59.880
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:06.250
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:06.250
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:14.960
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:14.960
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:21.490
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:21.490
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:28.200
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:28.200
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.810
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.810
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:36.350
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:36.350
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:38.380
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:38.380
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:45.890
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:45.890
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:56.360
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:56.360
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.670
Let's eat.

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.210
You have an amazing appetite.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:14.250
I have to eat a lot first
if I want to gain muscle mass.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.980
But, still...

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:18.490
Miss Layla said she would
eat her meal in her room again today.

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:19.280
What?

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.210
She stopped trying to lose weight, didn't she?

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.120
She said that she wanted to
keep her concentration.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.620
Oh, I'll take her meal to her.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.740
An Amazing Bond

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.740
"An Amazing Bond"

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:37.640
An Amazing Bond

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:39.930
Here it is.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:43.800
You seem a little tired, Miss Layla.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.310
Maybe...

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.480
If that's the case,

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.510
in Japan, we have something
we call "Ume-boshi".

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:53.720
It's VERY sour, but it works
when you're tired.

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:56.160
I have some specially pickled by my mother.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.990
I'll go get some for you right now.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:02:59.260
Don't worry.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.750
I'll be okay if I sleep well tonight.

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:03.860
Oh... Are you sure?

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.370
Thanks for your concern, though.

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:09.710
I understand.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.640
Then please get some rest.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.610
Good night!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:37.030
It will be all right by tomorrow.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.300
By tomorrow...

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:44.700
You're making me dizzy! Let me go!

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.340
You're so violent!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.080
Say whatever you want.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:55.520
But I'm in a good mood because
Miss Layla and I are finally partners for real!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.110
Even I think it's weird.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:03.990
But I think no matter what
the legendary great maneuver is like,

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.660
I think I can definitely pull it off.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:09.390
I don't think I'm going to fail.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.800
So don't you think it's about time?

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.200
Tell me about the legendary great maneuver.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.200
No, not yet.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:19.500
What?

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:21.530
The reversed Empress.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.100
A suffering queen.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.740
A suffering queen? It means...

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.190
Miss Layla!

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:33.980
What's wrong?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.290
Didn't you just hit your shoulder?

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.990
I just lost my balance
and scratched it a little.

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:40.520
You don't need to worry.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.000
Could it be...

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.970
She really hit her shoulder after all?

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.940
No, it can't be.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:48.960
It can't be. It can't be.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.470
Because she made a promise
not to keep any secrets.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:56.170
'Cause I'm Miss Layla's partner.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.350
Using the swing, jump across
to the log over there.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.550
Then push off that log with your hand
and come back to the original swing.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:11.760
This will be the final stage of practice.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:28.910
Sora, you're late!

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.780
Sorry.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.540
I'm late because I was putting this on!

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:37.010
This way, I weigh the same as Miss Layla.

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.520
What is that?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.680
Weights used for scuba diving.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:43.580
Will you be all right?

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.030
I can't let you bear all the burden.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:52.030
Because we're partners, aren't we?

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:55.530
You're right.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:02.040
Sora, you still don't have enough skill.
But we don't have time.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.770
Work yourself to death and master it.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.270
We're going back to Kaleido Stage tomorrow.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.280
Yes.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:13.250
Match each other's timing.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.460
Sora's lagging.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:23.690
I wonder if it's because of those weights.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:27.800
Go for it!

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:32.610
You can, like, do it!

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.440
Let me worry about the timing.

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:35.340
Just put everything you have into it.

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.670
Okay.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.990
Good. Your timing is getting synchronized.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:17.780
Please let me try one more time.

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:36.870
I did it.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.270
Miss Layla!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.610
Are you all right, Miss Layla?

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:45.780
Yes.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.120
I'm sorry.

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:50.080
It's because you're
matching your timing to me...

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.550
It's not your fault.

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:55.590
Let's continue. We shouldn't waste time.

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:56.850
Okay.

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:13.840
Please...

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.740
A little longer...

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:17.580
Please last a little longer.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.590
Miss Layla!

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.700
Miss Layla, is something wrong?!

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:43.940
No. It's nothing.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.110
But...

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.370
I said it's nothing!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.670
Really, it's nothing.

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:56.450
Miss Layla...

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:59.510
I'm positive she was holding her
right shoulder back then.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:04.460
Could she be hiding an injury?

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:06.860
But, why?

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:10.420
She promised to tell me
everything from now on.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:13.930
Oh, yes.

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:30.780
She laughed.

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:31.650
Good.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.320
Why in the world are you
wearing something like that?

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:38.160
Ken said that you looked down.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:41.290
So we wondered if you were worrying
about the show the day after tomorrow.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:42.330
You don't need to worry.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.300
Young woman!

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:46.430
Believe in your future!

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.710
Do you think maybe this was a bad idea?

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:53.500
Do you think?

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:58.640
Thank you, Mia, Anna!

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:00.680
You're right.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:04.120
The only thing I can do is believe. Right?

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:05.490
That's right, Sora.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:06.690
Fight!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:07.480
Yes!

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.860
I already made up my mind
to believe in Miss Layla.

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:13.290
Once I made up my mind like this,

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:16.820
I have to believe in Miss Layla no matter what.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.140
The upright Moon.

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:31.880
Lingering doubts and hidden anxieties.

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:38.880
Can you really believe in her
no matter what, Sora?

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:01.340
We've returned to Kaleido Stage.

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:07.040
Miss Layla and l
both did everything we could.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:12.620
Tomorrow, we're going to
perform before the audience.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.060
And yet...

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:18.120
And yet you still say we're not qualified?

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:35.140
Welcome back.

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:35.980
Welcome back.

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:35.980
Welcome back.

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:36.570
Welcome back.

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:39.710
Oh... Well...

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:41.340
All of you...

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:45.050
Welcome back, Layla, Sora.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:46.420
Jean...

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:51.530
Everyone here realized that
the current Kaleido Stage is a fake.

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:53.160
Tomorrow's show...

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:54.800
Until it's your time to appear,

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.560
we're going to do our best
to heighten the atmosphere.

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.560
Let us be part of a true show.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.770
Let's work together again!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.000
Everyone...

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:11.940
What are you doing?

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:22.060
Has that so-called
spirit of the stage qualified you?

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.180
That's what I thought.

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.930
It just means that you're
not capable after all.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.400
You should just admit it.

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.970
If you do that, I can cancel
the performance with just one phone call,

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:35.090
and finish everything for you.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.930
Don't worry them unnecessarily.

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:41.640
How dare you say something like that?!

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.800
You don't give a damn about the cast's life!

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:47.710
It's about time to wake up, Layla.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:51.820
There's no way that you'll be able to do
the legendary great maneuver.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.320
It's impossible.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:54.090
You know that, don't you?

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:54.220
Yuri, stop.

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:54.220
You know that, don't you?

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:54.920
Yuri, stop.

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:56.320
You're just going to waste your life.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:56.820
Yuri!

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:56.820
You're just going to waste your life.

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:57.120
Yuri!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.400
Don't you see that Kalos is deceiving you?!

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:01.360
He's using you!

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:02.560
It doesn't matter!

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:07.990
I believe that I'm able to perfect
the legendary great maneuver.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:12.430
Everyone here wants tomorrow's
performance to succeed...

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:14.140
All except you.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.370
Not Kalos.

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:19.680
He's trying to profit from your death,

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.340
and take over as owner again.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.750
Just like he did to my father.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.280
Am I right?!

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:31.990
But, unfortunately,

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:34.730
whether you perfect the maneuver or not,

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.160
Kaleido Stage is finished!

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:37.470
What?!

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:38.260
What do you mean?

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:44.170
Kaleido Stage will be sold
after tomorrow's show.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:46.710
That is the investors' idea.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:52.380
So no matter what you do, it's useless!

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:55.140
That's why perfecting the
legendary great maneuver means nothing!

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:07.480
I was proud to be partnered with you.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:11.020
So don't make an unsightly scene in front of me.

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:13.270
Sora...

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:14.060
Yes.

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:19.460
No matter what happens,
we will do our best tomorrow.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:21.970
Yes.

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:25.980
We will never cancel the show.

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:39.530
This is not good.

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:42.120
It seems what I did a second ago
made my condition much worse.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.340
Familiar smell,

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:49.100
familiar atmosphere...

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:52.000
I'm at Kaleido Stage again.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:56.140
Everyone was waiting for us,

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:58.700
for Miss Layla and me.

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:05.180
But, we're not qualified to perform
the legendary great maneuver yet.

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:07.680
Sora!

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:10.790
Do you know where Miss Layla is?

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:12.620
I want to start rehearsal, but...

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.300
I don't know where she is...

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.260
Really?

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.130
I wonder where she went.

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:25.670
Here I thought I hadn't
seen you in a long time...

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.630
How you could do this to yourself
and let it get this bad?

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:31.940
The pain must be excruciating.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.850
Since you forced yourself to keep training
after you pulled your muscle,

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:39.450
you're suffering from a stress fracture.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:42.490
We need to get you hospitalized immediately.

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:44.010
No, I can't.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:46.160
Tomorrow is the date of the performance.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.630
Layla, you can't do that.

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:50.060
If you put unnecessary stress on it now,

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:51.530
your right shoulder will never be...

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:52.620
I don't care.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:53.900
Layla!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:57.400
Just do something about this pain.

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:00.910
And please don't say anything
about this to anybody.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:02.910
Are you serious?

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:05.370
I am.

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:12.620
Layla! Layla!

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:17.560
So don't make an unsightly scene in front of me.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.650
Unsightly scene?

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.130
Yes.

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:27.330
What?!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:29.800
Miss Layla?

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:38.600
How is Miss Layla?

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:40.980
She's sleeping right now.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:43.380
Is her shoulder hurting?

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:44.910
You knew that?

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:48.290
I thought so... That time...

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:50.150
Miss Layla!

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:52.960
You don't need to worry.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.950
So, she did hit her shoulder.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.860
How is her condition?

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.570
Oh... well...

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:02.930
Then tomorrow's performance will be...

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.970
I... I think I have to wait and observe
her condition a little more.

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:10.980
It's my fault.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:14.850
I noticed it at the time.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.390
But, l...

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.690
YOU!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.020
Are you going to kill Layla too?!

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:21.450
Please stop it, Mr. Yuri!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:24.690
Sora!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:27.150
Stop it! This is a hospital!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.170
If Sora noticed her condition,

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:33.070
there is no way that Kalos
missed it as a coach.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:36.640
This guy knew what was going on,
and he still let Layla do it!

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.110
I don't think...

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:39.730
Kalos would never do something like that!

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:42.740
No. He's right.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.470
What?

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:48.880
I noticed Layla's shoulder was hurting.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:50.720
What? Then, why?

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:51.890
It's obvious!

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.720
In order to get Kaleido Stage back!

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:56.150
No.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.460
You're wrong, Yuri.

00:17:58.630 --> 00:17:59.630
Layla...

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:00.790
Miss Layla...

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.950
I'm sorry, but I contacted them.

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:04.330
I know.

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:07.540
Kalos didn't say anything

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:10.330
because this is a matter
I should decide entirely for myself.

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.230
Isn't that right, Kalos?

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:18.340
I should have done the same for Arlon.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.780
After I saw his practice,

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:26.310
I knew how difficult that maneuver was.

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:31.050
And of course,
I knew how dangerous it was too.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:36.660
Arlon said that he would make sure
to perfect the legendary great maneuver

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:39.720
in order to make Kaleido Stage
more successful.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.960
I thought I had faith in those words.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:47.330
But on the final day of rehearsal,

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:48.980
I asked him,

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.380
"Are you sure you can do it?"

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:58.940
I am the one who caused him to worry.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:04.390
I should have believed
in him to the last, but I didn't.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.230
That's why, this time,

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:13.260
I'm going to believe in both
Layla and Sora to the last.

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:16.990
You finally broke free from the past, Kalos.

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:18.840
Hah, this is stupid!

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:21.810
You can't fool me with pretty words!

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:24.370
Anyway, tomorrow's show is canceled!

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:28.210
If you do that, I'll never forgive you.

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:32.050
Layla, don't you understand
that I'm saying it's impossible?

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:34.520
First of all, you're injured.

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:36.560
Miss Layla...

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:37.460
Well...

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:39.620
I think it would be better if we cancel this time.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:41.620
What did you say?

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.700
Anyhow, let's get your shoulder
completely healed first!

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:46.700
Then we can try it.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.070
We'll have another chance at it!

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:48.200
When?!

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:48.200
We'll have another chance at it!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:48.860
When?!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.740
Oh... well, um...

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:51.570
A month later?

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:52.640
A year later?

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:53.440
Ten years later?

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:54.980
Well...

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:56.710
And even then,
will there still be a Kaleido Stage?

00:19:57.950 --> 00:20:00.040
Can you tell me that
you won't be injured at that time?

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.950
And what will have happened to me by then?

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.080
Well, that...

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.520
I don't know, but...

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:08.280
What about those people who have been
looking forward to seeing the show?

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:11.010
The show already has started.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:15.020
I can't bear the thought of
disappointing someone.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:20.460
After my mother passed away,
and I watched my father drown in grief,

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:25.440
I pledged to myself that
I would never make my father sad.

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:26.510
In spite of that...

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:30.680
Anyway, make sure to finish the movie shoot.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.980
After that, do whatever you want.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.970
...I disappointed him.

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.880
I don't want to disappoint anybody anymore.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.490
Why?

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:47.160
Why do you insist on it that much,
even betting on your own life?

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.760
Yuri, you've changed,
to not know something like that.

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:54.660
I do it because I'll receive
the best applause when I perfect it.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.900
The best applause...

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:01.000
The best applause...

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:05.110
This is a duel between me and my fate.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:07.280
I'm going to win,

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:10.310
and I'll make sure
I'll receive the best applause.

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:13.090
If I back out now,

00:21:13.090 --> 00:21:15.850
I don't know if I'll ever feel the same again.

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:18.250
That's why this is the only chance.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:21.760
This is how I feel right now, Sora.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:23.630
Miss Layla,

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.400
I understand how you feel.

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:28.870
In order to receive the best applause,

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:31.360
I'll also challenge fate with you!

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:38.540
Why? For Kaleido Stage?

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:40.780
To tell you the truth,

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:44.750
I just want to attempt
this maneuver. That's all.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:46.950
When I've done it right,
please give me a big hand.

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:48.890
Okay.

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:51.280
Father...

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:56.990
Do whatever you like.

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:00.160
Yuri...

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:04.770
So you're not afraid of dying?

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:07.370
We're not going to die.

00:22:08.610 --> 00:22:10.870
We'll make sure to succeed.

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:16.150
The time is ripe.

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:21.990
Next Kaleido Star

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:24.690
The time is ripe.

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:25.420
Miss Layla.

00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:26.150
Sora...

00:22:26.330 --> 00:22:26.990
Layla...

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:27.990
Sora!

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:28.890
Layla...

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:29.760
Sora...

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:30.500
Layla...

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:31.260
Sora...

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:31.990
Layla...

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:32.690
Sora...

00:22:34.340 --> 00:22:36.140
Yume... Everyone...

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:36.930
We're...

00:22:37.370 --> 00:22:38.360
Let's start, Sora.

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:39.600
Yes!

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:42.710
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"An Amazing Comeback"

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:44.750
An Amazing Comeback

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:44.750
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"An Amazing Comeback"

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:45.080
An Amazing Comeback

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:46.280
An Amazing Comeback

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:46.280
My wings are my dream

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:47.720
An Amazing Comeback

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:47.720
and on towards the sky!

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:47.770
An Amazing Comeback

00:22:51.150 --> 00:23:04.000
<i>Boku wa koko ni iru
sora to michi no aida de mukai kaze</i>

00:22:51.150 --> 00:23:04.000
<i>I'm here between the sky and the roads,
and facing against the wind</i>

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:17.780
<i>Soshite mae o muiteiru,
mou nido to kanashimi ga furanai youni to</i>

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:17.780
<i>And I'm facing forward so the sorrow
doesn't rain down ever again</i>

00:23:17.780 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>Ano kabe o koete kokomade kitanda</i>

00:23:17.780 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>I came all the way here after
I jumped over that wall</i>

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:31.030
<i>Nigedashitaku naru koto wa nando mo aru</i>

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:31.030
<i>There are many times
when I just want to run away</i>

00:23:31.030 --> 00:23:36.360
<i>Dakedo kokoni irunara taishite bibitte inai</i>

00:23:31.030 --> 00:23:36.360
<i>But I'm still here,
so, I'm not daunted that much</i>

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:43.800
<i>Kakinaguri no uta "hajimekara yareba iisa"</i>

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:43.800
<i>The poem I scribbled down, I can just
start writing over from the beginning</i>

00:23:43.800 --> 00:23:50.180
<i>Umaku kakenaku te boku wa waratte iru</i>

00:23:43.800 --> 00:23:50.180
<i>Unable to write it well, I'm laughing</i>
